            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Personal Life and Personality</strong><br>\nKnown for his charismatic personality and quick smile, Gagarin was not only a skilled pilot but also a loving family man, married with two daughters.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Honors and Recognition</strong><br>\nYuri Gagarin received numerous awards and honors during his life, and his legacy continues with monuments and his name given to various space-related sites and institutions.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Remembering a Hero</strong><br>\nGagarin remains a revered figure in Russia and worldwide, a symbol of human bravery and the spirit of exploration, celebrated each year on Yuri's Night, April 12.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
